(both laugh)

104
00:04:02.055 --> 00:04:04.550
And I appreciate that honesty from you guys

105
00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:06.430
'cause I don't know that we're sure either.

106
00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:07.600
You are everything.

107
00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:08.700
There's nothing you can't do.

108
00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:10.620
You as Pesci I just think needs to happen.

109
00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:12.570
Or his daughter, but I want you as Pesci.

110
00:04:12.570 --> 00:04:13.847
Thank you, finally.

111
00:04:13.847 --> 00:04:16.680
(crowd cheering)
(applause)

112
